Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Start with one cluster per node, then consider pairs with positive affinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}从每个节点各自成簇开始，只考虑亲和度为正的簇对。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:10.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Discard pairs that would exceed capacity, and choose the strongest remaining pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:10.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}排除合并后超容量的簇对，再选择剩余候选中亲和度最高的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.75,0:00:17.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}For ties, sort the members within each cluster, then order the two clusters lexicographically.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.75,0:00:17.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}出现平局时，先对每个簇的成员标签排序，再按字典序排列簇对。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:22.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Compare the first member list, then the second; the smallest pair wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:22.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}先比较第一个成员列表，再比较第二个，字典序最小的簇对优先。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:29.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Our slides and code share this rule; upstream instead uses synthetic cluster identifiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:29.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}本课幻灯片与两种实现统一使用这条规则；上游则使用生成的簇编号。
